# Turnify Backend

## Golden rule — English only

All **code** must be English:

- File and folder names
- Variables, functions, classes, modules
- DB tables and columns
- JSON request/response field names
- Error `message` strings in API responses
- Comments in code (prefer none; if needed, English)

Spanish is allowed only in `docs/design/` (product design docs).

## Skills

When coding under `src/`, follow:

- `.cursor/skills/turnify-rest-errors/SKILL.md`
- `.cursor/skills/turnify-solid-clean-arch/SKILL.md`
- `.cursor/skills/turnify-design-compliance/SKILL.md`

## Stack

Node.js + Express + PostgreSQL + Sequelize + JWT + Zod + pino.

## Errors

- No silent catches
- Envelope `{ error: { code, message, details } }`
- Typed domain/app errors; HTTP mapping only in error middleware

## Roles (domain terms → English code)

| Domain (docs) | Code |
|---------------|------|
| Admin plataforma | `scope: 'platform'` user |
| Gerente | `manager` membership on a `business` |
| Empleado | `Professional` entity (no login MVP) |
| Cliente | `Client` entity |
| Negocio | `Business` |
| Cita | `Appointment` |
